  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-116188",
  "summary": "rclone serve s3 1.75.0 before 1.75.2 Memory Limit Bypass via Multipart Overflow",
  "details": "rclone serve s3 versions 1.75.0 before 1.75.2 contain an integer overflow vulnerability in multipart reorder-memory accounting that bypasses the configured buffer limit. Attackers can open two concurrent current-part PUT requests declaring huge lengths to wrap the signed int64 counter and retain out-of-order parts in memory, exhausting the host.",
